        <mxCell id="br_box_p3" value="&lt;b&gt;Business Rules Enforced (Process 3):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;BR-001:&lt;/b&gt; reporter_id dari auth user | &lt;b&gt;BR-002:&lt;/b&gt; Status awal OPEN | &lt;b&gt;BR-003:&lt;/b&gt; technician_id nullable awal&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;BR-004:&lt;/b&gt; Hanya Manager/Admin assign | &lt;b&gt;BR-005:&lt;/b&gt; Tech hanya proses assigned tickets&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;BR-008:&lt;/b&gt; Semua perubahan status ke ticket_histories | &lt;b&gt;BR-009:&lt;/b&gt; Ticket CLOSED immutable Employee&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;BR-011:&lt;/b&gt; Asset optional | &lt;b&gt;BR-012/014:&lt;/b&gt; Validasi kepemilikan asset di backend | &lt;b&gt;BR-015:&lt;/b&gt; ON DELETE SET NULL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#b1b1b1;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
